sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant CHM as Chat Modal
    participant W as AI Worker
    participant TM as Task Manager
    participant API as Backend API
    participant TS as Tool Services
    participant WD as Workers Dashboard
    participant ES as Error Service

    Note over U, CHM: Task execution error scenario
    U->>CHM: "Create social media campaign"
    CHM->>W: Process task request
    W->>TM: Create task
    TM->>API: POST /api/tasks/create
    API->>TM: Task created successfully
    TM->>CHM: Show task in progress
    
    Note over W, TS: Tool connection failure
    W->>TS: Connect to social media tools
    TS-->>W: Connection timeout
    W->>ES: Log error event
    ES->>W: Return error handling strategy
    W->>CHM: "❌ Unable to connect to social media tools"
    CHM->>U: Show error message with options
    
    Note over U, CHM: User chooses retry
    U->>CHM: Click "Retry Connection"
    CHM->>W: Retry request
    W->>TS: Retry tool connection
    TS->>W: Connection successful
    W->>CHM: "✅ Connection restored, continuing task"
    CHM->>U: Show success message
    
    Note over W, TM: Task execution failure
    W->>TS: Execute social media posting
    TS-->>W: API rate limit exceeded
    W->>ES: Log rate limit error
    ES->>W: Suggest backoff strategy
    W->>TM: Update task status to "Delayed"
    TM->>CHM: Update task card status
    W->>CHM: "⚠️ Rate limited, will retry in 15 minutes"
    CHM->>U: Show delay notification
    
    Note over ES, W: Automatic retry mechanism
    ES->>ES: Wait for retry interval
    ES->>W: Trigger retry
    W->>TS: Retry social media posting
    TS->>W: Posting successful
    W->>TM: Update task status to "Running"
    TM->>CHM: Update task progress
    W->>CHM: "✅ Task resumed successfully"
    
    Note over W, API: Critical system error
    W->>API: Save task progress
    API-->>W: Database connection failed
    W->>ES: Log critical error
    ES->>API: Check system health
    API-->>ES: Multiple services down
    ES->>W: Activate emergency mode
    W->>CHM: "🚨 System maintenance in progress"
    CHM->>U: Show maintenance message
    
    Note over ES, WD: System recovery
    ES->>API: Monitor service restoration
    API->>ES: Services back online
    ES->>W: Resume normal operation
    W->>API: Retry failed operations
    API->>W: Operations successful
    W->>CHM: "✅ System restored, tasks resumed"
    CHM->>U: Show recovery notification
    
    Note over U, CHM: User-initiated error resolution
    U->>CHM: "Why did my email campaign fail?"
    CHM->>W: Process inquiry
    W->>ES: Query error logs for user task
    ES->>W: Return error details
    W->>CHM: "Email failed due to invalid recipient list"
    CHM->>U: Show detailed error explanation
    
    U->>CHM: "Can you fix the recipient list?"
    CHM->>W: Process fix request
    W->>TS: Validate email addresses
    TS->>W: Return validation results
    W->>CHM: "Found 15 invalid emails, removing them"
    W->>TM: Update task with corrections
    TM->>API: Save corrected task
    API->>TM: Corrections saved
    W->>CHM: "✅ Recipient list cleaned, restarting campaign"
    
    Note over W, ES: Worker health monitoring
    ES->>W: Health check ping
    W-->>ES: No response (worker crashed)
    ES->>WD: Update worker status to "Offline"
    WD->>U: Show worker offline indicator
    ES->>API: Initiate worker restart
    API->>W: Restart worker process
    W->>ES: Worker online confirmation
    ES->>WD: Update worker status to "Active"
    WD->>U: Show worker back online
    
    Note over ES, CHM: Graceful degradation
    ES->>ES: Detect high error rate
    ES->>TM: Enable fallback mode
    TM->>CHM: Show limited functionality notice
    CHM->>U: "Some features temporarily limited"
    U->>CHM: Continue with available features
    ES->>ES: Monitor system stability
    ES->>TM: Restore full functionality
    TM->>CHM: Clear limitation notice
    CHM->>U: "All features restored"
    
    Note over U, WD: Error reporting and analytics
    U->>WD: View dashboard after errors
    WD->>ES: Get error summary
    ES->>WD: Return error metrics
    WD->>U: Show error rate: 1.4% (-18% improvement)
    WD->>U: Display system reliability indicators 